					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-350419#post-4069442</guid>
				<title>Re: Wow great!</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-350419/scp-157#post-4069442</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 27 Nov 2018 19:12:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Generic_Viking</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4873703</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My understanding is that <em>because</em> it is so large, the organism is limited in what kind of object it can pretend to be, like some sort of psychic conservation of mass. It has to be something people want to interact with, and a couch is one of the few large items a person will spend time on. It is possible that every officer saw a different style of couch.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-350419#post-4062850</guid>
