				<wikidot:authorName>eric_h</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>474585</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The point there is if you see someone interacting with SCP-157, you probably see the SCP as something different, and the effect will be comedic rather than of impending danger &#8212; someone putting food on their head, or starting to cut up and eat a shoe &#8212; the victim is about to kill himself with the SCP, and you're probably standing there either laughing at him or wondering if he's gone crazy.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
